==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*2 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Gilgamesh (Enemy)|Gilgamesh]] spawns as the boss.
**8 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**8 [[Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns after 70 seconds<sup>2,100f</sup>.
**2 [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 56.67~60 seconds<sup>1,700f~1,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
While Gilgamesh is normally very threatening, he only appears in this stage at 10% magnification, meaning his health is only 150,000. Additionally, he has a massive blind spot that isn't fully covered by any of the other enemies. [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] and/or [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] can deal with the peons relatively easily, so do your best to wear him down over time. Be mindful that Gilgamesh has 8 knockbacks and will be repositioning regularly, and that he gets stronger at half health.

